=== one rule, two spellings, as Tcl properties on the design
property                     type    status        engine     detail
HeldNext_A                   assert  proven        informal-ic3
HeldPast_A                   assert  cex           informal-ic3 depth 1
cycle  PRESETn  ARVALID  ARREADY
    0        0        1        0
    1        1        0        0
verdict: six rules proved; each mutant caught, two by an assertion and one by a cover
